            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-71302",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/panthor: fix for dma-fence safe access rules"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/panthor: fix for dma-fence safe access rules\n\nCommit 506aa8b02a8d6 (\"dma-fence: Add safe access helpers and document\nthe rules\") details the dma-fence safe access rules. The most common\nculprit is that drm_sched_fence_get_timeline_name may race with\ngroup_free_queue."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-71302",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-71302\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2025-71302](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-71302)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/panthor: fix for dma-fence safe access rules\n\nCommit 506aa8b02a8d6 (\"dma-fence: Add safe access helpers and document\nthe rules\") details the dma-fence safe access rules. The most common\nculprit is that drm_sched_fence_get_timeline_name may race with\ngroup_free_queue.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-71302**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2025-71302](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-71302)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/panthor: fix for dma-fence safe access rules\n\nCommit 506aa8b02a8d6 (\"dma-fence: Add safe access helpers and document\nthe rules\") details the dma-fence safe access rules. The most common\nculprit is that drm_sched_fence_get_timeline_name may race with\ngroup_free_queue."
              },
