            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-63859",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: net: airoha: Add missing bits in airoha_qdma_cleanup_tx_queue()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: airoha: Add missing bits in airoha_qdma_cleanup_tx_queue()\n\nSimilar to airoha_qdma_cleanup_rx_queue(), reset DMA TX descriptors in\nairoha_qdma_cleanup_tx_queue routine. Moreover, reset TX_DMA_IDX to\nTX_CPU_IDX to notify the NIC the QDMA TX ring is empty."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-63859",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-63859\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-63859](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-63859)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: airoha: Add missing bits in airoha_qdma_cleanup_tx_queue()\n\nSimilar to airoha_qdma_cleanup_rx_queue(), reset DMA TX descriptors in\nairoha_qdma_cleanup_tx_queue routine. Moreover, reset TX_DMA_IDX to\nTX_CPU_IDX to notify the NIC the QDMA TX ring is empty.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-63859**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-63859](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-63859)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: airoha: Add missing bits in airoha_qdma_cleanup_tx_queue()\n\nSimilar to airoha_qdma_cleanup_rx_queue(), reset DMA TX descriptors in\nairoha_qdma_cleanup_tx_queue routine. Moreover, reset TX_DMA_IDX to\nTX_CPU_IDX to notify the NIC the QDMA TX ring is empty."
              },
