            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-90324",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  u ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nublk: check import_ubuf() return value\n\nimport_ubuf() can fail if the address range (provided by the userspace\nublk server) is outside the allowed user address space. Return that 0\nbytes were copied if import_ubuf() fails rather than passing an\nuninitialized struct iov_iter to ublk_copy_user_pages()."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90324",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-90324\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-90324](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90324)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nublk: check import_ubuf() return value\n\nimport_ubuf() can fail if the address range (provided by the userspace\nublk server) is outside the allowed user address space. Return that 0\nbytes were copied if import_ubuf() fails rather than passing an\nuninitialized struct iov_iter to ublk_copy_user_pages().",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-90324**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-90324](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90324)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nublk: check import_ubuf() return value\n\nimport_ubuf() can fail if the address range (provided by the userspace\nublk server) is outside the allowed user address space. Return that 0\nbytes were copied if import_ubuf() fails rather than passing an\nuninitialized struct iov_iter to ublk_copy_user_pages()."
              },
