            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-98332",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  w ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mac80211: only operate on TDLS peers in the TDLS code\n\nieee80211_tdls_oper() can operate on the AP station, which then\nyields various warnings when the AP station is removed then or\nat a later point in time after being confused for a TDLS peer.\n\nAlways check that the station is a TDLS peer."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-98332",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-98332\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-98332](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-98332)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mac80211: only operate on TDLS peers in the TDLS code\n\nieee80211_tdls_oper() can operate on the AP station, which then\nyields various warnings when the AP station is removed then or\nat a later point in time after being confused for a TDLS peer.\n\nAlways check that the station is a TDLS peer.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-98332**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-98332](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-98332)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mac80211: only operate on TDLS peers in the TDLS code\n\nieee80211_tdls_oper() can operate on the AP station, which then\nyields various warnings when the AP station is removed then or\nat a later point in time after being confused for a TDLS peer.\n\nAlways check that the station is a TDLS peer."
              },
              "properties": {
