            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-98346",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  w ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: cfg80211: don't get the radio mask for netdev-less wdevs\n\ncfg80211_calculate_bi_data() calls rdev_get_radio_mask() with\nwdev-\u003enetdev, which can be NULL and then crashes in mac80211.\n\nTo avoid that, invert the order of checks since wdev-\u003enetdev\nis always valid for beaconing interfaces."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-98346",
              "help": {
